<view wx:if="{{report}}" class="page relationship-map map-enter">
  <view class="map-header"><view class="page-kicker">关系说明书 · 可以继续修改</view><view class="map-title">我目前比较确定的</view><view class="map-summary">{{report.title}}</view><view class="map-intro">这些是你答过、也可以继续修改的东西。关系经历变化以后，答案本来就可能不同。</view></view>
  <view class="map-section map-section--claims">
    <view class="map-section__heading"><view class="map-section__index">01</view><view><view class="map-section__title">目前比较明显的</view><view class="map-section__desc">每句话都可以打开、核对或改掉。</view></view></view>
    <view wx:for="{{groups}}" wx:for-item="group" wx:key="id" class="map-group">
      <view class="map-group__title">{{group.title}}</view>
      <view class="map-list map-claim-list">
        <view wx:for="{{group.claims}}" wx:for-item="claim" wx:key="id" class="map-claim" hover-class="map-claim--active" aria-role="button" data-id="{{claim.id}}" bind:tap="openClaim">
          <view class="map-claim__topline"><text class="map-claim__label">{{claim.mapLabel}}</text><text class="map-claim__status">{{claim.mapStatus}}</text></view>
          <view class="map-claim__title">{{claim.title}}</view><view class="map-claim__footer"><text>打开这句话的依据</text><text class="dl-chevron">›</text></view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{confirmed.length}}" class="map-section"><view class="map-section__heading"><view class="map-section__index">02</view><view><view class="map-section__title">你自己也觉得比较像的</view><view class="map-section__desc">这些是你已经看过并回应过的描述。</view></view></view><view class="map-list"><view wx:for="{{confirmed}}" wx:key="id" class="map-fact"><view class="map-fact__label">你的回应</view><view class="map-fact__text">{{item.title}}</view></view></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{unknowns.length}}" class="map-section map-section--open"><view class="map-section__heading"><view class="map-section__index">03</view><view><view class="map-section__title">暂时还说不清的</view><view class="map-section__desc">回答不够时，先保留问题，不急着补出结论。</view></view></view><view wx:for="{{unknowns}}" wx:key="id" class="map-open-question"><view class="map-open-question__title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="map-open-question__text">{{item.text}}</view></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{history.length > 1}}" class="map-section map-section--history"><view class="map-section__heading"><view class="map-section__index">04</view><view><view class="map-section__title">以前的版本</view><view class="map-section__desc">旧版本保留当时的回答，不会覆盖现在这份。</view></view></view><view class="map-list"><button wx:for="{{history}}" wx:key="id" class="map-history" data-id="{{item.id}}" bind:tap="openHistory"><view><view class="map-history__title">版本 {{item.version}} · {{item.title}}</view><view class="map-history__date">{{item.date}}{{item.current ? ' · 当前版本' : ''}}</view></view><text class="dl-chevron">›</text></button></view><button wx:if="{{isViewingHistory}}" class="dl-button dl-button--outline map-history-return" bind:tap="returnCurrent">返回当前版本</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{showFollowup}}" class="map-next"><view class="map-next__kicker">接下来由你决定</view><view class="map-next__title">如果愿意，可以把一两件事聊得更具体</view><view class="map-next__desc">问卷能看见一些规律，真实经历通常会让它更清楚。后续访谈、研究或线下活动都会单独说明并征求同意。</view><button class="map-next__button" bind:tap="openFollowup">了解后续参与</button></view>
  <view class="map-section map-section--other"><button class="dl-list-row dl-list-row--button" bind:tap="openReport"><view class="dl-list-row__body"><view class="dl-list-row__title">回到完整说明书</view><view class="dl-list-row__desc">逐条查看、核对或修改你的回答</view></view><text class="dl-chevron">›</text></button></view>
</view>
